  "limitations": [
    "This is a one-call scalar low-factor instance. It does not prove both seeds or the full factored_s2_libra_weights generated helper/loop.",
    "The helper field operations are explicitly installed operation slots; actual field operation refinement remains separate.",
    "The P6 kpowers/from_fn model and iterator-fold model have separate Rust Std correspondence boundaries.",
    "The helper is an extracted candidate/source cut, not an adopted frozen Rust source caller proof.",
    "No theorem links this call to the enclosing Weights::pair caller, its ap0/ap1 construction, or return/state/error continuation.",
    "Normal Weights::pair factors are not generally kpowers; this kpowers specialization is applicable to factored_s2_libra_weights only when its actual q=kpowers result is supplied.",
    "No Lean object files are included. Object hashes and producer receipts are pinned."
  ],
